--- !u!114 &9093455937849817580
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2622783118287655734}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dc6dff0039d305647946fcf7b383d248, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  confirmWindow: {fileID: 0}
  confirmButton: {fileID: 0}
  skipButton: {fileID: 5962901631202051853}
  skipConfirmButton: {fileID: 0}
  skipCancelButton: {fileID: 0}
  promptText: {fileID: 1295281264515738810}
  prompts:
  - Peep, my feathery friend... You have soo much to learn!
  - See your face right there? A healthy bird is important so make sure to always
    look your best!
  - That GREEN bar? Stamina help you RUN and FLAP your way out of danger. Or in...
    It's your choice...
  - The WHITE? What do we do best? POOP! Make sure to keep that belly full!
  - 'Always keep an eye out at your MINI-MAP and COMPASS! '
  - This POINTER shows you what direction youre looking!
  - Now for some basics. WASD or LEFT STICK lets you WALK around. MOUSE or RIGHT
    STICK moves the camera!
  - Great! Press SPACE or A BUTTON to JUMP!
  - Now JUMP then press SPACE  or A BUTTON again to start flying!
  - You've done so well Peep! There's a few other pigeons you should go see...
  - Coobert will show you how to SNEAK around
  - Ruffle can tell you where to find food
  - Race Arnesto to test your skills
  - 'Anytime you think you''re ready, you can take the Coober to Pigeonton Market! '
  - You can use E or X BUTTON to INTERACT or SPEAK with other pigeons
  - If you need to see the controls again you can find them in the PAUSE menu with
    ESCAPE or START BUTTON!
  promptIndex: 0
  canvasController: {fileID: 0}
